---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import mediaAlchemy from '../../assets/editorial/media-alchemy-ritual-4k.avif';
const { base = '/' } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="studio-signal" aria-labelledby="studio-signal-title">
  <div class="shell studio-signal-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">HardMagic Studio · multimodal field</p>
    <h2 id="studio-signal-title">One direction.<br /><em>Many forms.</em></h2>
    <p>Studio joins models, compute, provenance, and human review into a directed media practice. This field combines current self-hosted audio with HardMagic-directed editorial studies; every object names its actual workflow.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="studio-reel shell">
    <figure class="studio-frame studio-frame-wide">
      <Picture src={mediaAlchemy} alt="A creative director shapes a suspended field of crimson light inside a dark soundstage." formats={[]} fallbackFormat="avif" width={1920} widths={[720, 1200, 1920, 2560]} sizes="100vw" loading="lazy" />
      <span class="studio-frame-shade" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <figcaption class="studio-frame-copy"><span>IMAGE / ART DIRECTION</span><b>Human authority inside machine-scale production.</b><small>OpenAI ImageGen · HardMagic-directed editorial concept · August 12, 2026</small></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <article class="studio-audio">
      <div class="audio-wave" aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({ length: 52 }, (_, index) => <i style={`--h:${18 + ((index * 37) % 74)}%`}></i>)}</div>
      <div class="audio-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">VOICE / DIRECTED SYNTHESIS</p>
        <h3>A future, felt.</h3>
        <p>An emotionally directed performance generated on HardMagic’s self-hosted Fish Audio S2-Pro lane. Text-only synthesis. No cloned identity. No autoplay.</p>
        <audio controls preload="metadata">
          <source src={`${base}media/audio/hardmagic-working-signal.ogg`} type="audio/ogg; codecs=opus" />
          Your browser does not support embedded audio.
        </audio>
        <details><summary>Read transcript and provenance</summary><p>“The future does not arrive as a trend report. It arrives as a feeling, just before the world has words for it. A screen becomes a collaborator. A campaign becomes an organism. An audience becomes part of the story. And suddenly, the impossible feels inevitable. HardMagic is building that future now. Make what comes next.”</p><dl><div><dt>Model</dt><dd>Fish Audio S2-Pro</dd></div><div><dt>Direction</dt><dd>Soft → whispered → curious → moved → hopeful → confident</dd></div><div><dt>Voice</dt><dd>Default text-only synthesis; no cloned identity</dd></div><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>Opus · 48 kHz · 22.61 seconds</dd></div><div><dt>Generated</dt><dd>HardMagic self-hosted inference · August 13, 2026</dd></div></dl></details>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="shell studio-signal-end"><a class="button light" href="products/studio/">See how Studio works</a><a class="text-link" href="products/studio/hybrid-inference/">Inspect hybrid inference <b>↗</b></a></div>
</section>
